                "metamorphic violation: equivalent LPs produced different optimum values; "
                    + "v1=" + v1 + " v2=" + v2 + " factor=" + factor
                    + " rotate=" + rotate + " geq=" + useGeqForm + " minimize=" + useMinimizeEquivalent);
