        // parseInto updates the supplied instant with the parsed fields, preserves unspecified
        // fields like time-of-day/zone, and returns the index immediately after the parsed text.
        // A "fix" that merely suppresses the throw, skips state updates, or returns a wrong
        // position would violate these observable post-conditions.

